1
00:00:01,007 --> 00:00:02,927
♪

2
00:00:12,727 --> 00:00:14,647
( Eugeo sighs )

3
00:00:16,307 --> 00:00:18,017
( girl sighs )

4
00:00:18,017 --> 00:00:19,147
HELLO.

5
00:00:21,487 --> 00:00:23,447
WE ARE--I MEAN...

6
00:00:23,447 --> 00:00:26,277
I AM FIZEL, A SISTER-IN-TRAINING
OF THE CHURCH.

7
00:00:26,277 --> 00:00:28,447
HOW DO?

8
00:00:28,447 --> 00:00:31,787
AND THIS TIMID LITTLE THING
IS MY FELLOW SISTER-IN-TRAINING.

9
00:00:31,787 --> 00:00:33,247
Linel: UH, I’M LINEL.

10
00:00:33,247 --> 00:00:35,497
Fizel: WE HEARD
THERE WERE INTRUDERS

11
00:00:35,497 --> 00:00:37,627
FROM THE DARK TERRITORY
LURKING ABOUT.

12
00:00:37,627 --> 00:00:39,337
ARE YOU THEY?

13
00:00:39,337 --> 00:00:40,127
Eugeo: HUH?

14
00:00:42,257 --> 00:00:44,627
Kirito: I THINK
I’LL LET YOU HANDLE THIS ONE.

15
00:00:44,627 --> 00:00:46,217
THEY LOOK ANNOYING.

16
00:00:47,587 --> 00:00:49,547
( Eugeo sighs )

17
00:00:49,547 --> 00:00:51,717
UM, WE ARE, SORT OF.

18
00:00:51,717 --> 00:00:53,597
WE’RE ACTUALLY
FROM THE HUMAN REALM,

19
00:00:53,597 --> 00:00:55,437
NOT THE DARK TERRITORY.

20
00:00:55,437 --> 00:00:59,937
AS FOR INTRUDING HERE,
I GUESS WE ARE, TECHNICALLY.

21
00:01:01,187 --> 00:01:03,147
( girls sigh )

22
00:01:03,147 --> 00:01:04,857
Fizel: WELL, NEL? DO THESE TWO

23
00:01:04,857 --> 00:01:08,487
LOOK ANYTHING
LIKE MONSTERS TO YOU? HUH?

24
00:01:08,487 --> 00:01:10,157
WHERE ARE
THEIR HORNS AND TAILS?

25
00:01:10,157 --> 00:01:11,827
Linel: BUT HOW SHOULD I KNOW?

26
00:01:11,827 --> 00:01:14,747
I WAS JUST TELLING YOU WHAT
THE BOOK SAID THEY LOOKED LIKE.

27
00:01:14,747 --> 00:01:17,417
YOU’RE THE ONE
JUMPING TO CONCLUSIONS, ZEL.

28
00:01:17,417 --> 00:01:18,287
Eugeo: UH, LADIES...

29
00:01:19,377 --> 00:01:20,997
WE’LL GO.

30
00:01:20,997 --> 00:01:22,547
IF SOMEONE SEES US,
YOU’LL GET IN TROUBLE.

31
00:01:25,257 --> 00:01:26,337
( girls giggle )

32
00:01:28,717 --> 00:01:31,387
Fizel: DON’T WORRY. THERE’S
NO CHANCE OF THAT HAPPENING.

33
00:01:31,387 --> 00:01:32,927
THIS MORNING, THE CHURCH ORDERED

34
00:01:32,927 --> 00:01:34,807
ALL THE MONKS, NUNS,
AND APPRENTICES

35
00:01:34,807 --> 00:01:37,557
TO STAY IN THEIR QUARTERS
AND LOCK THEIR DOORS.

36
00:01:37,557 --> 00:01:40,897
THIS WAS THE PERFECT OPPORTUNITY
FOR US TO SNEAK OUT

37
00:01:40,897 --> 00:01:43,527
AND HAVE A LOOK
AT THESE NASTY INTRUDERS.

38
00:01:43,527 --> 00:01:45,357
EH? ( grunts )

39
00:01:45,357 --> 00:01:46,357
HUH.

40
00:01:46,357 --> 00:01:48,197
( Eugeo sighs )

41
00:01:48,197 --> 00:01:49,567
Fizel: THEY’RE HUMAN.

42
00:01:49,567 --> 00:01:50,947
- Linel: YES, VERY.
- ( Eugeo chuckles )

43
00:01:52,827 --> 00:01:54,327
Linel: WE HEARD
YOU WERE ARRESTED,

44
00:01:54,327 --> 00:01:57,367
BUT BROKE YOUR SPIRITUAL CHAINS
AND ESCAPED.

45
00:01:57,367 --> 00:01:59,827
WE ALSO HEARD YOU DEFEATED
TWO INTEGRITY KNIGHTS.

46
00:01:59,827 --> 00:02:01,247
THAT’S WHY I WAS SURE

47
00:02:01,247 --> 00:02:03,207
YOU WERE MONSTERS
FROM THE DARK TERRITORY,

48
00:02:03,207 --> 00:02:05,707
EITHER THAT
OR KNIGHTS OF DARKNESS.

49
00:02:05,707 --> 00:02:08,547
I’M SURE YOU CAN UNDERSTAND WHY
WE WERE SO CURIOUS ABOUT YOU.

50
00:02:08,547 --> 00:02:11,137
( Eugeo sighs ) HUH?

51
00:02:12,507 --> 00:02:14,137
Linel: ONE LAST THING,

52
00:02:14,137 --> 00:02:16,097
DO YOU MIND TELLING US
WHAT YOUR NAMES ARE?

53
00:02:18,437 --> 00:02:20,687
Eugeo: EH, NOT AT ALL.

54
00:02:20,687 --> 00:02:23,937
I’M EUGEO,
AND THIS HERE IS KIRITO.

55
00:02:23,937 --> 00:02:25,187
- ( Kirito groans )
- Linel: HUH.

56
00:02:25,187 --> 00:02:27,607
DO YOU NOT HAVE LAST NAMES?

57
00:02:27,607 --> 00:02:30,607
Eugeo: NO.
MY FAMILY ARE SETTLERS.

58
00:02:30,607 --> 00:02:32,657
AND DO YOU HAVE LAST NAMES?

59
00:02:32,657 --> 00:02:36,237
Linel: YES. WE’VE BEEN WAITING
TO SHARE THEM WITH YOU.

60
00:02:36,237 --> 00:02:37,367
Eugeo: UH...

61
00:02:37,367 --> 00:02:39,207
- ( blade stabs )
- ( groaning )

62
00:02:43,837 --> 00:02:45,667
Linel: MY FULL NAME, SINNER,

63
00:02:45,667 --> 00:02:48,797
IS LINEL SYNTHESIS TWENTY-EIGHT.

64
00:02:48,797 --> 00:02:50,427
( singing in Japanese )

65
00:02:50,427 --> 00:02:52,927
♪

66
00:03:21,667 --> 00:03:23,957
♪ PROUD OF MYSELF ♪

67
00:03:31,467 --> 00:03:33,137
♪

68
00:04:26,807 --> 00:04:28,137
( Eugeo gasping )

69
00:04:31,397 --> 00:04:32,477
( Kirito gasps ) EUGE--

70
00:04:32,477 --> 00:04:34,017
- ( blade stabs )
- ( groaning )

71
00:04:37,527 --> 00:04:41,737
( Fizel chuckles ) MY NAME
IS FIZEL SYNTHESIS TWENTY-NINE.

72
00:04:41,737 --> 00:04:44,197
Eugeo: YOU’RE A...

73
00:04:45,617 --> 00:04:47,617
INTEGRI...

74
00:04:47,617 --> 00:04:49,197
( both groan )

75
00:04:54,707 --> 00:04:57,667
Linel: DON’T FRET,
EUGEO WITHOUT-A-LAST-NAME.

76
00:04:57,667 --> 00:04:59,167
YOU’RE OURS NOW.

77
00:05:00,967 --> 00:05:02,627
( footsteps shuffling )

78
00:05:04,887 --> 00:05:06,217
( Eugeo grunting )

79
00:05:06,217 --> 00:05:08,097
Linel: IT’S A PARALYSIS POISON.

80
00:05:08,097 --> 00:05:10,597
WE DON’T WANT YOU TO DIE YET,

81
00:05:10,597 --> 00:05:13,557
NOT UNTIL WE GET YOU
TO THE 50th FLOOR, ANYWAY.

82
00:05:13,557 --> 00:05:15,767
I’M SURE
YOU MUST BE WONDERING...

83
00:05:16,857 --> 00:05:18,607
"HOW IN THE WORLD

84
00:05:18,607 --> 00:05:20,897
DID THESE TWO LITTLE GIRLS
BECOME INTEGRITY KNIGHTS?"

85
00:05:20,897 --> 00:05:22,737
( Eugeo gasping )

86
00:05:24,737 --> 00:05:27,697
Linel: WE WERE BORN AND RAISED
INSIDE THE CENTRAL CATHEDRAL.

87
00:05:29,037 --> 00:05:31,827
ONE DAY, ADMINISTRATOR HERSELF

88
00:05:31,827 --> 00:05:34,207
ORDERED THE MONKS AND NUNS HERE
TO CREATE US.

89
00:05:35,707 --> 00:05:37,287
SHE NEEDED TEST SUBJECTS

90
00:05:37,287 --> 00:05:39,957
FOR A SACRED ART
SHE WAS EXPERIMENTING WITH

91
00:05:39,957 --> 00:05:41,717
THAT COULD RESURRECT THE DEAD.

92
00:05:43,337 --> 00:05:46,387
WE RECEIVED OUR CALLINGS
WHEN WE WERE FIVE,

93
00:05:46,387 --> 00:05:48,057
EARLIER THAN OTHER CHILDREN.

94
00:05:48,057 --> 00:05:51,887
OUR JOB WAS TO KILL EACH OTHER.

95
00:05:51,887 --> 00:05:54,767
WE WERE GIVEN LITTLE SWORDS
THAT LOOKED LIKE TOYS.

96
00:05:54,767 --> 00:05:57,977
THEN, WE’D PAIR OFF AND
TAKE TURNS STABBING EACH OTHER.

97
00:05:57,977 --> 00:05:59,977
( singers vocalizing )

98
00:05:59,977 --> 00:06:01,897
♪

99
00:06:07,527 --> 00:06:08,407
( blade stabs )

100
00:06:29,597 --> 00:06:33,427
Fizel: AT FIRST, ADMINISTRATOR’S
ATTEMPTS AT RESURRECTION WERE--

101
00:06:33,427 --> 00:06:35,437
HOW SHALL I SAY? NOT SO GOOD.

102
00:06:36,977 --> 00:06:39,517
THERE WERE SOME CHILDREN
WHO EXPLODED

103
00:06:39,517 --> 00:06:43,857
AND OTHERS WHO ENDED UP
AS WEIRD BLOBS OF FLESH.

104
00:06:43,857 --> 00:06:47,487
AND STILL OTHERS WHO RETURNED,
BUT WERE DIFFERENT.

105
00:06:47,487 --> 00:06:50,327
Linel: WE WERE BEING
RESURRECTED OVER AND OVER,

106
00:06:50,327 --> 00:06:52,537
BUT WE DIDN’T LIKE
DYING IN PAIN,

107
00:06:52,537 --> 00:06:55,747
SO THE TWO OF US RESEARCHED
HOW TO KILL WITH ONE STRIKE.

108
00:06:55,747 --> 00:06:57,577
WE FOUND THAT IF
WE KILLED CLEANLY,

109
00:06:57,577 --> 00:07:00,167
IT DIDN’T HURT AS MUCH
AND THE ODDS OF BEING

110
00:07:00,167 --> 00:07:03,007
SUCCESSFULLY RESURRECTED
WERE HIGHER,

111
00:07:03,007 --> 00:07:05,007
BUT...

112
00:07:05,007 --> 00:07:09,007
THE PROBLEM WAS DECIDING
WHICH STRIKE WORKED THE BEST.

113
00:07:09,007 --> 00:07:11,967
WE NARROWED IT DOWN
TO LOPPING OFF THE HEAD

114
00:07:11,967 --> 00:07:15,597
OR A QUICK STAB TO THE HEART.
THEY BOTH WORKED EQUALLY WELL.

115
00:07:18,397 --> 00:07:19,687
IN THE END, THOUGH,

116
00:07:19,687 --> 00:07:21,817
ADMINISTRATOR DECIDED
IT WAS TOO DIFFICULT

117
00:07:21,817 --> 00:07:24,067
TO MASTER THE SACRED ART
OF RESURRECTION.

118
00:07:24,067 --> 00:07:25,897
WE WERE ABOUT EIGHT YEARS OLD

119
00:07:25,897 --> 00:07:28,817
WHEN SHE ABANDONED
THE EXPERIMENT.

120
00:07:28,817 --> 00:07:31,447
WHEN IT STARTED,
THERE WERE 30 OF US,

121
00:07:31,447 --> 00:07:33,947
BUT ZEL AND I
WERE THE ONLY SURVIVORS.

122
00:07:33,947 --> 00:07:35,617
( Eugeo gasping )

123
00:07:37,657 --> 00:07:41,077
Linel: THEN ADMINISTRATOR
MADE A SPECIAL EXCEPTION

124
00:07:41,077 --> 00:07:43,127
AND MADE US INTEGRITY KNIGHTS.

125
00:07:43,127 --> 00:07:45,257
WELL, TO A CERTAIN DEGREE.

126
00:07:45,257 --> 00:07:47,087
SHE SAID
WE HADN’T LEARNED ENOUGH

127
00:07:47,087 --> 00:07:49,797
TO GO ON GUARD DUTY
LIKE THE OTHER KNIGHTS,

128
00:07:49,797 --> 00:07:52,757
SO WE’VE BEEN STUDYING
THE LAWS AND SACRED ARTS

129
00:07:52,757 --> 00:07:55,387
WITH THE OTHER APPRENTICES
FOR THE PAST TWO YEARS.

130
00:07:55,387 --> 00:07:57,977
TO BE HONEST,
WE’RE TIRED OF IT.

131
00:07:59,727 --> 00:08:02,107
Fizel: EARLIER TODAY,
WE WERE DISCUSSING WAYS

132
00:08:02,107 --> 00:08:05,477
TO EARN OUR DRAGONS
AND DIVINE OBJECTS MORE QUICKLY.

133
00:08:05,477 --> 00:08:07,937
WE HEARD THAT MINIONS
FROM THE DARK TERRITORY

134
00:08:07,937 --> 00:08:10,777
HAD INFILTRATED THE CATHEDRAL,

135
00:08:10,777 --> 00:08:13,447
SO WE THOUGHT, IF WE COULD
CAPTURE AND EXECUTE THEM

136
00:08:13,447 --> 00:08:15,197
BEFORE THE OTHER KNIGHTS COULD,

137
00:08:15,197 --> 00:08:17,867
IT WOULD SHOW ADMINISTRATOR
HOW CAPABLE WE WERE

138
00:08:17,867 --> 00:08:19,867
AND SHE WOULD MAKE US
FULL-FLEDGED KNIGHTS,

139
00:08:19,867 --> 00:08:21,377
SO WE WAITED ON THE STAIRS.

140
00:08:24,207 --> 00:08:27,007
Linel: WE’RE TRULY SORRY
FOR USING POISON ON YOU.

141
00:08:27,007 --> 00:08:29,167
IT WAS OUR ONLY OPTION.

142
00:08:29,167 --> 00:08:31,467
YOU SEE,
WE WANTED TO BRING YOU

143
00:08:31,467 --> 00:08:33,717
TO THE 50th FLOOR ALIVE,
IF POSSIBLE.

144
00:08:33,717 --> 00:08:37,267
OH, AND WHEN WE DO GET THERE,
DON’T YOU WORRY.

145
00:08:37,267 --> 00:08:39,937
FIZEL AND I
ARE REALLY GOOD AT KILLING.

146
00:08:39,937 --> 00:08:41,227
IT WON’T HURT AT ALL.

147
00:08:47,857 --> 00:08:50,817
( both groan )

148
00:08:50,817 --> 00:08:52,737
♪

149
00:08:57,737 --> 00:09:01,957
Linel: WELL, WELL, IF IT ISN’T
ALL FOUR OF THE WHIRLING BLADES,

150
00:09:01,957 --> 00:09:06,247
AS WELL AS VICE COMMANDER
FANATIO SYNTHESIS TWO.

151
00:09:06,247 --> 00:09:08,627
Fizel: THE WHOLE SENATE
MUST BE IN A PANIC.

152
00:09:08,627 --> 00:09:10,507
WHY ELSE
WOULD THEY ASK YOU HERE,

153
00:09:10,507 --> 00:09:12,757
FANATIO OF
THE HEAVEN-PIERCING BLADE?

154
00:09:12,757 --> 00:09:16,757
Fanatio: YOU APPRENTICES
SHOULD NOT BE ON THE BATTLEFIELD

155
00:09:16,757 --> 00:09:18,217
WITH HONORABLE KNIGHTS.

156
00:09:18,217 --> 00:09:20,927
( Fizel laughs )
NOW, THAT IS FUNNY!

157
00:09:20,927 --> 00:09:24,057
IT’S BECAUSE YOU BRING HONOR
AND TRADITION INTO BATTLE,

158
00:09:24,057 --> 00:09:26,767
THAT YOU SO-CALLED
MIGHTY INTEGRITY KNIGHTS LOST

159
00:09:26,767 --> 00:09:29,027
NOT ONCE, BUT TWICE!

160
00:09:29,027 --> 00:09:30,857
BUT DON’T YOU WORRY.

161
00:09:30,857 --> 00:09:33,237
AS YOU CAN SEE,
WE CAUGHT THE INTRUDERS,

162
00:09:33,237 --> 00:09:35,777
AND WE’LL MAKE SURE
THE REPUTATION OF THE KNIGHTS

163
00:09:35,777 --> 00:09:39,197
WON’T BE SULLIED ANY FURTHER.
YOU CAN COUNT ON THAT.

164
00:09:39,197 --> 00:09:40,537
Linel: SHE’S RIGHT!

165
00:09:40,537 --> 00:09:41,957
WE’RE GOING TO DECAPITATE
THESE SINNERS

166
00:09:41,957 --> 00:09:43,207
RIGHT HERE AND NOW,

167
00:09:43,207 --> 00:09:45,667
SO WATCH CLOSELY, AND MAKE SURE

168
00:09:45,667 --> 00:09:48,877
TO GIVE AN ACCURATE REPORT
TO THE PONTIFEX.

169
00:09:48,877 --> 00:09:51,467
YOU ARE HONORABLE KNIGHTS,
AFTER ALL.

170
00:09:51,467 --> 00:09:53,837
WE TRUST YOU
NOT TO STEAL OUR CREDIT.

171
00:09:53,837 --> 00:09:55,177
THAT WOULD BE COWARDLY.

172
00:09:55,177 --> 00:09:57,007
♪

173
00:10:00,677 --> 00:10:01,767
( girls gasp )

174
00:10:03,137 --> 00:10:05,187
Linel: NO FAIR.

175
00:10:05,187 --> 00:10:06,767
Fizel: I CAN’T...

176
00:10:06,767 --> 00:10:07,607
( both moan )

177
00:10:16,157 --> 00:10:18,077
( Linel shuddering )

178
00:10:26,917 --> 00:10:28,167
( Eugeo groans )

179
00:10:28,167 --> 00:10:29,797
Kirito: IT’LL WEAR OFF
IN A MINUTE.

180
00:10:29,797 --> 00:10:33,087
AS SOON AS YOU CAN MOVE
YOUR LIPS AGAIN,

181
00:10:33,087 --> 00:10:35,967
RECITE YOUR PERFECT WEAPON ART,
BUT KEEP IT DOWN.

182
00:10:35,967 --> 00:10:38,087
THIS AIN’T GONNA WORK
IF THE KNIGHTS HEAR.

183
00:10:38,087 --> 00:10:39,217
WHEN IT’S READY TO GO,

184
00:10:39,217 --> 00:10:41,057
HANG ON TO IT A BIT.

185
00:10:41,057 --> 00:10:42,427
WAIT FOR MY SIGNAL.

186
00:10:48,017 --> 00:10:51,017
I’M SURE YOU’RE WONDERING,
HOW IN THE WORLD CAN I MOVE?

187
00:10:53,237 --> 00:10:56,317
YOU GAVE YOURSELVES AWAY.

188
00:10:56,317 --> 00:10:58,817
YOU SAID ALL THE MONKS,
NUNS, AND APPRENTICES

189
00:10:58,817 --> 00:11:01,117
WERE ORDERED
TO STAY IN THEIR ROOMS,

190
00:11:01,117 --> 00:11:03,537
AND IF YOU’RE A MONK,
NUN, OR APPRENTICE,

191
00:11:03,537 --> 00:11:05,827
THERE’S NO WAY YOU’D
DISOBEY THE CHURCH’S ORDER.

192
00:11:07,247 --> 00:11:08,287
BUT YOU WEREN’T IN YOUR ROOMS.

193
00:11:08,287 --> 00:11:10,037
YOU WERE LOOKING FOR US,

194
00:11:10,037 --> 00:11:12,167
SO THAT MEANT YOU GUYS
WEREN’T REAL APPRENTICES.

195
00:11:15,007 --> 00:11:18,087
I ALSO NOTICED THOSE SCABBARDS
YOU GOT ARE MADE OF RUBY OAK.

196
00:11:18,087 --> 00:11:19,387
THEY USE THAT WOOD

197
00:11:19,387 --> 00:11:22,177
TO HOLD SWORDS
MADE OF TOXIC RUBERYL STEEL.

198
00:11:22,177 --> 00:11:24,177
WHY? ’CAUSE IT’S THE ONLY THING

199
00:11:24,177 --> 00:11:26,427
THAT WON’T ROT
AGAINST THE BLADE.

200
00:11:26,427 --> 00:11:28,307
THERE’S NO WAY
YOU’D HAVE SOMETHING LIKE THAT

201
00:11:28,307 --> 00:11:29,977
IF YOU WERE SISTERS-IN-TRAINING.

202
00:11:29,977 --> 00:11:34,027
THAT’S WHY I STARTED RECITING
A POISON-NEUTRALIZING ART

203
00:11:34,027 --> 00:11:35,687
BEFORE YOU GOT NEAR US.

204
00:11:35,687 --> 00:11:40,157
IT TOOK A WHILE TO KICK IN,
BUT WHAT CAN YOU DO?

205
00:11:40,157 --> 00:11:43,027
THERE’S MORE TO STRENGTH
THAN BEIN’ FAST WITH A SWORD.

206
00:11:44,117 --> 00:11:46,247
( Fizel gasping )

207
00:11:49,247 --> 00:11:50,827
( blades slice )

208
00:11:53,707 --> 00:11:55,667
( both sigh )

209
00:11:55,667 --> 00:11:58,047
DON’T WORRY. I WON’T KILL YOU.

210
00:11:58,047 --> 00:12:01,007
I’M GONNA TEACH YOU
A LESSON TODAY.

211
00:12:01,007 --> 00:12:03,467
YOU’RE GONNA WATCH THESE KNIGHTS
YOU MADE FUN OF FIGHT

212
00:12:03,467 --> 00:12:05,177
AND SEE WHAT REAL STRENGTH’S
ALL ABOUT.

213
00:12:05,177 --> 00:12:07,387
( footsteps receding )

214
00:12:07,387 --> 00:12:09,307
♪

215
00:12:15,727 --> 00:12:18,237
SORRY FOR THE WAIT,
VICE COMMANDER FANATIO.

216
00:12:23,067 --> 00:12:26,157
MY NAME’S KIRITO,
THE SWORDSMAN!

217
00:12:31,707 --> 00:12:33,627
♪

218
00:12:38,717 --> 00:12:39,507
( yells )

219
00:12:45,557 --> 00:12:48,847
Woman: HOW DARE YOU DO BATTLE
WITH THE VICE COMMANDER?!

220
00:12:48,847 --> 00:12:51,767
THE FOUR WHIRLING BLADES
ARE YOUR OPPONENTS HERE!

221
00:12:51,767 --> 00:12:53,267
TURN AND FACE US!

222
00:12:53,267 --> 00:12:55,227
Fanatio: HOLD YOUR POSITION.

223
00:12:55,227 --> 00:12:58,777
THIS ONE IS MINE.

224
00:12:58,777 --> 00:12:59,777
Woman: AS YOU WISH.

225
00:13:06,277 --> 00:13:08,327
Fanatio: SYSTEM CALL.

226
00:13:08,327 --> 00:13:10,787
ENHANCE ARMAMENT!

227
00:13:13,117 --> 00:13:15,707
( Kirito growls )

228
00:13:17,207 --> 00:13:19,547
( yells )

229
00:13:22,877 --> 00:13:24,047
( groans )

230
00:13:24,047 --> 00:13:24,967
( yells )

231
00:13:28,057 --> 00:13:29,637
( sighs )

232
00:13:33,347 --> 00:13:34,307
( gasps )

233
00:13:46,867 --> 00:13:47,527
( gasps )

234
00:13:51,117 --> 00:13:52,287
Eugeo: KI--

235
00:13:52,287 --> 00:13:53,867
( gasps )

236
00:13:53,867 --> 00:13:55,957
MY VOICE.

237
00:13:55,957 --> 00:13:56,707
IT’S BACK!

238
00:13:58,037 --> 00:13:59,837
SYSTEM CALL.

239
00:13:59,837 --> 00:14:01,757
( Kirito groaning )

240
00:14:08,427 --> 00:14:12,057
Fanatio: CRIMINAL OR NO,
IF YOU LIVED IN CENTORIA,

241
00:14:12,057 --> 00:14:14,017
YOU SHOULD KNOW
WHAT A MIRROR IS.

242
00:14:16,897 --> 00:14:18,437
IT IS AN INSTRUMENT

243
00:14:18,437 --> 00:14:22,567
CAPABLE OF REFLECTING
SOLUS’S LIGHT COMPLETELY.

244
00:14:22,567 --> 00:14:27,567
LONG AGO, THE PONTIFEX GATHERED
1,000 ENORMOUS MIRRORS

245
00:14:27,567 --> 00:14:30,077
TO FOCUS SOLUS’S
MIDSUMMER LIGHT,

246
00:14:30,077 --> 00:14:32,287
CREATING A PURE, WHITE FLAME.

247
00:14:32,287 --> 00:14:34,657
IT WAS SO HOT,

248
00:14:34,657 --> 00:14:38,537
IT MELTED A HUMAN-SIZED BOULDER
WITHIN MINUTES.

249
00:14:38,537 --> 00:14:42,507
THE PONTIFEX,
USING HER HOLY SKILLS,

250
00:14:42,507 --> 00:14:46,177
FUSED THE 1,000 MIRRORS
TOGETHER,

251
00:14:46,177 --> 00:14:49,717
THEN HONED THEM
TO CREATE A MAGNIFICENT SWORD...

252
00:14:51,137 --> 00:14:52,807
♪

253
00:14:56,307 --> 00:15:00,437
THIS SWORD,
THE HEAVEN-PIERCING BLADE.

254
00:15:00,437 --> 00:15:03,857
KNOW THIS. YOUR STOMACH AND FOOT
WERE PUNCTURED

255
00:15:03,857 --> 00:15:07,447
BY THE GLORIOUS POWER
OF THE SUN GOD, SOLUS.

256
00:15:07,447 --> 00:15:10,027
Kirito: IT REFLECTS
THE SUN’S ENERGY.

257
00:15:12,367 --> 00:15:16,367
Fanatio: NOW, SINNER,
PREPARE TO MEET YOUR END.

258
00:15:18,497 --> 00:15:19,827
Kirito: DISCHARGE!

259
00:15:22,167 --> 00:15:23,957
( groans )

260
00:15:25,337 --> 00:15:27,297
( Fanatio groans )

261
00:15:32,597 --> 00:15:34,017
( gasps )

262
00:15:34,017 --> 00:15:36,097
( both gasp )

263
00:15:37,227 --> 00:15:40,477
♪

264
00:15:40,477 --> 00:15:42,817
Fanatio:
DON’T YOU DARE LOOK AT ME.

265
00:15:44,647 --> 00:15:48,107
YOUR EYES
ARE LACED WITH DISDAIN,

266
00:15:48,107 --> 00:15:51,567
JUST LIKE THE COMMANDER’S!

267
00:15:51,567 --> 00:15:55,537
YOU MEN THINK MY GENDER
AFFECTS THE QUALITY OF MY SKILL.

268
00:15:55,537 --> 00:15:57,997
EVEN SINNERS DENY ME RESPECT!

269
00:15:57,997 --> 00:16:00,167
I COMMAND YOU
TO FIGHT ME IN EARNEST!

270
00:16:03,837 --> 00:16:07,337
I AM A KNIGHT,
AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT!

271
00:16:07,337 --> 00:16:09,507
( Kirito groaning )

272
00:16:09,507 --> 00:16:12,467
( Fanatio groaning )

273
00:16:12,467 --> 00:16:15,387
Kirito: I GET IT.
YOUR SWORD AND SKILL,

274
00:16:15,387 --> 00:16:16,597
IT’S A COVER.

275
00:16:16,597 --> 00:16:18,977
THEY LET YOU STAND BACK
AND FIRE SHOTS

276
00:16:18,977 --> 00:16:20,767
AND HIDE THE FACT
YOU’RE A WOMAN.

277
00:16:20,767 --> 00:16:24,017
AIN’T THAT RIGHT, LADY FANATIO?!

278
00:16:25,357 --> 00:16:26,607
Fanatio: HOW DARE YOU?!

279
00:16:26,607 --> 00:16:28,357
Kirito: JUST SO YOU KNOW,

280
00:16:28,357 --> 00:16:30,567
THE REASON I LOOKED
SO SHOCKED BEFORE,

281
00:16:30,567 --> 00:16:32,367
IT WASN’T ’CAUSE YOU’RE A WOMAN.

282
00:16:32,367 --> 00:16:34,197
IT’S ’CAUSE,
WHEN YOU LOST YOUR HELMET,

283
00:16:34,197 --> 00:16:35,617
YOU LOST ALL YOUR NERVE.

284
00:16:35,617 --> 00:16:38,577
I KNOW WHY YOU HIDE YOUR FACE
UNDER THAT HELMET.

285
00:16:38,577 --> 00:16:42,457
IF ANYONE HERE’S GOT A PROBLEM
WITH YOU BEIN’ A WOMAN,

286
00:16:42,457 --> 00:16:43,457
IT’S YOU.

287
00:16:43,457 --> 00:16:44,997
( Fanatio growls )

288
00:16:44,997 --> 00:16:47,257
SILENCE! YOU WRETCH!

289
00:16:47,257 --> 00:16:48,257
I SHALL KILL YOU!

290
00:16:48,257 --> 00:16:50,547
Kirito: YOU WANNA TRY, GO AHEAD!

291
00:16:50,547 --> 00:16:53,637
I KNOW WHAT IT’S LIKE
TO FIGHT AND LOSE TO WOMEN,

292
00:16:53,637 --> 00:16:55,177
AND YOU KNOW WHAT?

293
00:16:55,177 --> 00:16:57,137
I NEVER HELD BACK FOR THEM,

294
00:16:57,137 --> 00:16:59,137
AND I WON’T FOR YOU! ( grunts )

295
00:16:59,137 --> 00:17:01,187
( growls )

296
00:17:01,187 --> 00:17:03,097
♪

297
00:17:10,697 --> 00:17:13,027
( woman vocalizing )

298
00:17:17,487 --> 00:17:18,697
( Kirito sighs )

299
00:17:18,697 --> 00:17:20,037
( Fanatio chuckles )

300
00:17:23,117 --> 00:17:24,207
Eugeo: NO WAY.

301
00:17:33,007 --> 00:17:34,587
( both yell )

302
00:17:41,517 --> 00:17:42,517
Fanatio: I WAS WRONG.

303
00:17:42,517 --> 00:17:44,397
♪

304
00:17:44,397 --> 00:17:45,857
YOU ARE DIFFERENT.

305
00:17:45,857 --> 00:17:48,727
ALTHOUGH YOU MAY BE A SINNER,
YOU ARE QUITE UNLIKE

306
00:17:48,727 --> 00:17:50,357
THE OTHER MEN
I HAVE FOUGHT BEFORE.

307
00:17:52,197 --> 00:17:54,197
NONE OF THEM HAD YOUR SPIRIT.

308
00:17:54,197 --> 00:17:56,197
THEIR ATTACKS
ALL LACKED CONVICTION

309
00:17:56,197 --> 00:17:58,197
ONCE THEY SAW
MY DETESTABLE FACE.

310
00:17:58,197 --> 00:18:01,157
Kirito: "DETESTABLE"? OKAY...

311
00:18:01,157 --> 00:18:03,117
THEN HOW COME YOU COMB YOUR HAIR

312
00:18:03,117 --> 00:18:05,627
AND PUT ON LIPSTICK
IF YOU WEAR A HELMET?

313
00:18:05,627 --> 00:18:07,747
YOU DON’T DO IT FOR YOURSELF.
THAT’S FOR SURE.

314
00:18:07,747 --> 00:18:09,457
( Fanatio scoffs )

315
00:18:09,457 --> 00:18:11,547
♪

316
00:18:15,927 --> 00:18:17,717
Kirito: YOU’RE BITTER,
’CAUSE YOU CAN’T HAVE

317
00:18:17,717 --> 00:18:19,847
THE PERSON YOU LOVE,
AND YOU KNOW WHY?

318
00:18:19,847 --> 00:18:22,677
IT’S ’CAUSE THE CHURCH
AND THE PONTIFEX SAY YOU CAN’T.

319
00:18:22,677 --> 00:18:24,347
WELL, I’M HERE TO DESTROY ’EM

320
00:18:24,347 --> 00:18:27,397
AND FREE EVERYONE
FROM THEIR TYRANNY!

321
00:18:27,397 --> 00:18:29,817
Fanatio: I CAN TELL
YOU ARE NO AGENT OF DARKNESS,

322
00:18:29,817 --> 00:18:32,187
AS THE PRIME MINISTER CLAIMED.

323
00:18:32,187 --> 00:18:35,027
REGARDLESS, YOU ARE
STILL EXTREMELY DANGEROUS.

324
00:18:35,027 --> 00:18:38,237
YOU WOULD DISRUPT THE CHURCH
AND THE KNIGHTHOOD,

325
00:18:38,237 --> 00:18:41,657
NOT JUST WITH YOUR SWORD,
BUT WITH YOUR WORDS.

326
00:18:41,657 --> 00:18:45,367
YOU ALSO PUT
THE HUMAN EMPIRE IN PERIL,

327
00:18:45,367 --> 00:18:48,747
AND THAT, SIR,
IS A KNIGHT’S DUTY TO PROTECT.

328
00:18:48,747 --> 00:18:53,587
YOU SPEAK THE TRUTH,
BUT I AM OBLIGED TO DEFEAT YOU,

329
00:18:53,587 --> 00:18:56,717
EVEN IF IT SULLIES
MY PRIDE AS A KNIGHT!

330
00:18:56,717 --> 00:18:59,637
HIDDEN LIGHT
OF THE HEAVEN-PIERCING BLADE,

331
00:18:59,637 --> 00:19:01,757
CAST OFF YOUR SHACKLES!

332
00:19:01,757 --> 00:19:04,137
RELEASE RECOLLECTION!

333
00:19:14,777 --> 00:19:16,857
( Kirito groaning )

334
00:19:21,527 --> 00:19:22,737
( gasps )

335
00:19:22,737 --> 00:19:23,997
( woman gasps )

336
00:19:28,207 --> 00:19:29,577
Kirito: YOU IDIOT.

337
00:19:29,577 --> 00:19:31,457
( gasps )

338
00:19:31,457 --> 00:19:33,087
YOU’RE GONNA KILL US ALL!

339
00:19:36,717 --> 00:19:38,677
Eugeo: NOW’S MY CHANCE,

340
00:19:38,677 --> 00:19:40,757
MY ONLY CHANCE!

341
00:19:40,757 --> 00:19:43,767
ENHANCE ARMAMENT!

342
00:19:46,727 --> 00:19:49,307
( woman gasping )

343
00:19:49,307 --> 00:19:50,517
( grunts ) NO--

344
00:19:51,857 --> 00:19:53,227
Eugeo: BLUE ROSE! BLOOM!

345
00:19:55,527 --> 00:19:56,817
( Fanatio gasps )

346
00:19:56,817 --> 00:19:58,527
DAMN THAT BRAT!

347
00:19:58,527 --> 00:20:00,107
( gasps )

348
00:20:08,497 --> 00:20:09,497
( Kirito groans )

349
00:20:09,497 --> 00:20:10,577
Eugeo: KIRITO!

350
00:20:10,577 --> 00:20:12,287
ARE YOU HURT?! DON’T MOVE!

351
00:20:12,287 --> 00:20:13,287
I’LL HEAL YOU!

352
00:20:13,287 --> 00:20:14,297
Kirito: I’M FINE!

353
00:20:14,297 --> 00:20:16,757
DON’T LET UP! KEEP AT IT!

354
00:20:16,757 --> 00:20:18,627
SHE’S TOUGH.

355
00:20:20,047 --> 00:20:21,677
THIS AIN’T ENOUGH TO STOP HER!

356
00:20:24,507 --> 00:20:25,517
( groans )

357
00:20:28,227 --> 00:20:29,517
SYSTEM CALL.

358
00:20:31,437 --> 00:20:32,517
( Eugeo gasps )

359
00:20:35,357 --> 00:20:37,687
♪

360
00:20:39,277 --> 00:20:40,907
YOU KNIGHTS,

361
00:20:40,907 --> 00:20:42,737
YOU’RE ALL THE SAME!

362
00:20:42,737 --> 00:20:45,077
YOU’RE ALL HEARTLESS!

363
00:20:55,587 --> 00:20:57,297
STOP FIGHTING!

364
00:20:57,297 --> 00:20:58,377
STOP OR DIE!

365
00:20:58,377 --> 00:20:59,297
( gasps )

366
00:21:07,517 --> 00:21:09,637
IT’S NO USE.

367
00:21:09,637 --> 00:21:10,727
I CAN’T WIN.

368
00:21:10,727 --> 00:21:13,937
I CAN’T BEAT HER.

369
00:21:13,937 --> 00:21:16,357
Kirito: YOU’RE LETTING HATE
GET THE BETTER OF YOU, EUGEO.

370
00:21:16,357 --> 00:21:17,277
STOP IT.

371
00:21:20,607 --> 00:21:22,447
YOU DIDN’T COME THIS FAR

372
00:21:22,447 --> 00:21:25,577
’CAUSE YOU HATED
THE INTEGRITY KNIGHTS, DID YOU?

373
00:21:25,577 --> 00:21:28,827
YOU’RE HERE TO GET ALICE BACK.

374
00:21:28,827 --> 00:21:30,577
YOU’RE HERE ’CAUSE YOU LOVE HER.

375
00:21:30,577 --> 00:21:31,957
BUT GUESS WHAT.

376
00:21:31,957 --> 00:21:33,997
THAT INTEGRITY KNIGHT
OVER THERE,

377
00:21:33,997 --> 00:21:36,287
SHE FEELS JUST AS STRONG
ABOUT HER DUTY,

378
00:21:36,287 --> 00:21:38,497
AND I’M NO DIFFERENT.

379
00:21:38,497 --> 00:21:40,667
I WANNA PROTECT
EVERYONE IN THIS WORLD--

380
00:21:40,667 --> 00:21:43,377
YOU, ALICE,

381
00:21:43,377 --> 00:21:45,597
EVEN THIS KNIGHT.

382
00:21:45,597 --> 00:21:47,557
WE’RE SO CLOSE,

383
00:21:47,557 --> 00:21:49,557
AND WE CAN’T AFFORD
TO GIVE UP NOW.

384
00:21:51,557 --> 00:21:53,897
AIN’T THAT RIGHT, EUGEO?

385
00:21:55,347 --> 00:21:56,357
( Eugeo sighs )

386
00:22:01,277 --> 00:22:05,487
Kirito: ENHANCE ARMAMENT!

387
00:22:05,487 --> 00:22:09,577
Singer: ♪ OH, EVERYTHING
TURNS TO ASH, TO ASH ♪

388
00:22:09,577 --> 00:22:11,247
( singing in Japanese )

389
00:22:19,127 --> 00:22:22,587
♪ AND EVERYTHING
TURNS TO DUST, TO DUST ♪

390
00:22:22,587 --> 00:22:24,257
( singing in Japanese )

391
00:22:32,017 --> 00:22:34,227
♪ FORGET-ME-NOT ♪

